msgstr "The project-level cost estimate, with the contingency fund DEDUCTED. The contingency sits in the same place but nobody goes out and buys it — kept together, the \"remaining\" figure always looks comfortably large when it is not."

#. module: rp_purchase
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:rp_purchase.field_re_project__owner_cost_gap
